          "final_block": "The arrangement of Israel around the tent of meeting has been compared with Ramesside Qadesh reliefs depicting a royal campaign tent at the center of a bounded military camp. This comparison can help readers picture mobile architecture occupying a camp’s organizing center, but it remains disputed and does not establish that the royal tent was a sanctuary or that it supplied a blueprint for Israel’s camp.",
